# SEC-055-05: google-github-actions/auth writes a temporary Application
# Default Credentials file into $GITHUB_WORKSPACE (the repo root) by
# default, matching this glob - it must never be readable by `docker build .`
# even if the build ever ran after authentication. Belt-and-suspenders
# alongside deploy.yml's step ordering (build before auth); see
# docs/engineering/DEPLOYMENT.md "Service accounts".
gha-creds-*.json
